### Purpose: Send result to Google chat room & Fill in the testrun with the test result
###	1. Get running test case from autokiwi.qas.
###	2. Get testing result from {workspace}\log\{test case}\{test case}.xml
###	3. Merge all result and make them human readable.
### 4. Get testcase information(execution_id) from testrun
### 5. Generate a result list. * Format: [(execution_id, result),...]. e.g., [(51933, 'pass'), (51934, 'fail')]
### 6. Update testrun
### 7. Send result


start

### Step 1.
$qa_list$=get						autokiwi					qa_title_list		#path#=qa\autokiwi.qas

### Step 2.
$xml_list$=get						autokiwi					qa_result_list		#qa_title_list#=$qa_list$,#path_prefix#=autokiwi

### Step 3.
$overall_result$=get				autokiwi					overall_result		#qa_test_result#=$xml_list$,#environment#=QA Staging,#project_name#=Autokiwi,#unit#=APIs

### Step 4. 
$testrun_case_info$=get				autokiwi					testrun_case

### Step 5.
$final_result$=get					autokiwi					testrun_status		#testrun_case_info#=$testrun_case_info$,#xml_list#=$xml_list$

### Step 6.
update								autokiwi					testrun_status		#execution_result#=$final_result$

### Step 7.
#send								Fb							googlemessage		#message#=$overall_result$
